        "original_id": "97e57f48-6142-5ecb-9f2c-7a831f71eae9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: IO Theater, Comedy Central, CBS\n- People: Stephen Colbert, Amy Poehler\n- Products: The Colbert Report, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, Stephen Colbert Presents Stephen Colbert's Alpha Squad 7: A Tek Jansen Adventure\n- Characters: Tek Jansen\n- Topics: notable alumni, television hosting, animated shorts, comic series\n\nFacts:\n- IO Theater has notable alumni including Amy Poehler and Stephen Colbert.\n- Stephen Colbert hosted The Colbert Report on Comedy Central from 2005 to 2014.\n- In 2007, Tek Jansen became the protagonist of a five-part comic series.\n- Tek Jansen later appeared in the animated shorts Stephen Colbert Presents Stephen Colbert's Alpha Squad 7: A Tek Jansen Adventure, in which Stephen Colbert voiced Jansen.\n- Stephen Colbert began hosting The Late Show with Stephen Colbert on CBS in September 2015.",
